{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">明年維園農曆年宵市場攤位，今日起一連三日公開競投。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首日競投的包括4個快餐攤位和濕貨攤位。快餐攤位底價由約12萬元起，其中一個鄰近天后港鐵站出入口的，經11口叫價，以最高28萬元成交，較去年高約兩成。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MARKET-1100_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026f4TbdEM5op1791344515.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MARKET-1100_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">明年羊年大年初一是2月6日，年宵市場由1月31起一連七日舉行。全港最大的維園年宵市場有400個攤位，超過一半是乾貨攤位，一連三日在荔枝角政府合署競投。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MARKET-1100.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026NS0i2FUMiI1791344513.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MARKET-1100.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T04:38:32.660105+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}